# Rust contracts

- Follow patterns in `.agents/skills/near-smart-contracts/` (rules + SKILL.md).
- Use `#[near(bindgen)]`, `#[payable]`, and storage collections per NEAR SDK docs.
- Build: `cargo near build non-reproducible-wasm` (artifact: `target/near/auction_contract.wasm`).
- Test locally with sandbox tests under `contract/tests/` before testnet deploy.
- For upgrades/migrations, read the upgrade rules in the smart-contracts skill before changing stored state layout.
